@testray.main.component.name = "Support QA"
@type = "koroneiki"

Feature: Koroneiki Contact API Permission Check
	Testing Koroneiki Contact API Permissioning functionality.

Teardown:
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the permissions for a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" set for a non permissioned user
	* I tear down the external links for the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" on koroneiki with the following entity id values
	| 1234 |
	* I tear down the contacts on koroneiki with the following email addresses
	| koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |

Scenario: Create contact attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts that are attempted to be created by non permissioned users should not get created.

	Given I attempt to create a contact on koroneiki with the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

Scenario: View contact attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts created via API should not be viewable via API by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: View contact attempt via okta id as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts created via API should not be viewable via okta id via API by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: View contact attempt via uuid as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts created via API should not be viewable via uuid via API by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the uuid of the contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Update contact attempt as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contacts should not be able to be updated by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I attempt to update a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" as a non permissioned user

