	| Update | true |
	| View   | true |
	And I attempt to update a koroneiki contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" to have the following values as a non permissioned user
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the okta ID "koroneikicontact1" and the following values
