	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken"
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" as a non permissioned user

Scenario: Unset contact permission attempt via uuid as non permissioned user
	Koroneiki contact permissions should not be able to be unset via uuid via API by non permissioned users.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Update | true |
	| View   | true |
	And I attempt to unset the following permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" for a permissioned user as a non permissioned user
	| Update | true |
	| View   | true |
	And I update a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values as a permissioned user
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values as a permissioned user
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact2@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact2                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

