	And I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"

Scenario: Delete contact as permissioned user with contact permissions set by uuid
	Koroneiki contacts should be removable by permissioned users with their permissions set by uuid.

	Given I create a contact on koroneiki with the following values
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
	And I set the permissions for a contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" to have the following values for a non permissioned user
	| Delete | true |
	And I delete a contact on koroneiki with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" as a permissioned user
	Then I should not be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken"
