	| View | true |
	Then I should be able to view a koroneiki contact with the email address "koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken" and the following values as a permissioned user
	| Email Address | koroneiki.contact1@lrcustomer.com.broken |
	| First Name    | Koroneiki                                |
	| Language      | English                                  |
	| Last Name     | Contact1                                 |
	| Middle Name   | User                                     |
